<title>ZIMBABWE: Zimbabwe Nov CPI inflation falls to 13.9 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Zimbabwe Nov CPI inflation falls to 13.9 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>HARARE 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zimbabwe's all-items consumer price index dipped 2.0 percent in November from October, bringing the year-on-year rate to 13.9 percent, the Central Statistical Office said.</p>
<p>				    Nov 1996    Oct 1996    Nov 1995</p>
<p>Year-on-year pct change     +13.9	 +20.2	 +26.3</p>
<p>All-items index		 417.3	 425.9	 366.5</p>
<p>Food-only index		 531.4	 560.1	 493.3</p>
<p>NOTE - Index base 1990=100</p>
<p>-- Harare newsroom: +2634 72 52 27/8/9.</p>
</text>
